localhost/fisica/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GEO_3920-2.jpg\" alt=\"Galeria do Laboratório de Física Moderna\"></a><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(7848,1254,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(7849,1254,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(7850,1254,'_elementor_version','3.32.1'),(7851,1254,'_wp_page_template','elementor_header_footer'),(7852,1254,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"3017a5c2\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7df9a67b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<section class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-page\\\"><header class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-hero\\\"><span class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-eyebrow\\\">Instituto de F\\u00edsica UERJ<\\/span><h1>Gradua\\u00e7\\u00e3o<\\/h1><p>Apresenta\\u00e7\\u00e3o institucional do curso de F\\u00edsica do Instituto de F\\u00edsica \\u201cArmando Dias Tavares\\u201d \\u2014 IFADT\\/UERJ, nas modalidades Bacharelado e Licenciatura.<\\/p><\\/header><section class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-section\\\" aria-label=\\\"Modalidades do curso\\\"><div class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-section__head\\\"><p><span class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-section__eyebrow\\\">Modalidades<\\/span><\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-section__body\\\"><div class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-modalidades\\\"><article class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-card\\\"><h3>Bacharelado em F\\u00edsica<\\/h3><p>O Bacharel em F\\u00edsica ou o F\\u00edsico trabalha essencialmente na pesquisa cient\\u00edfica em universidades e centros de pesquisa, no ensino universit\\u00e1rio (gradua\\u00e7\\u00e3o e p\\u00f3s-gradua\\u00e7\\u00e3o), e em atividades de extens\\u00e3o. Necessita, para tanto, de forma\\u00e7\\u00e3o consistente e postura cr\\u00edtica. Essas qualidades s\\u00e3o aprimoradas ao longo dos quatro anos de dura\\u00e7\\u00e3o do curso e na p\\u00f3s-gradua\\u00e7\\u00e3o que \\u00e9 vista como uma sequ\\u00eancia natural e essencial para o futuro pesquisador.<\\/p><div class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-card__actions\\\"><a class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-card__button\\\" href=\\\"#\\\">Fluxograma<\\/a><br \\/><a class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-card__button\\\" href=\\\"#\\\">Ementas<\\/a><\\/div><\\/article><article class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-card\\\"><h3>Licenciatura em F\\u00edsica<\\/h3><p>Nossa licenciatura forma seus alunos para atuarem como Professores de F\\u00edsica no Ensino M\\u00e9dio. Com professores qualificados na \\u00e1rea de Ensino de F\\u00edsica, o IFADT visa fornecer requisitos essenciais para o exerc\\u00edcio da profiss\\u00e3o docente, proporcionando forma\\u00e7\\u00e3o consistente em F\\u00edsica, meios para a constru\\u00e7\\u00e3o continuada do conhecimento e o desenvolvimento de habilidades e atitudes que capacitem o Licenciado a atuar como agente formador da cidadania. Como no Bacharelado, essas qualidades s\\u00e3o aprimoradas ao longo dos quatro anos de dura\\u00e7\\u00e3o do curso e nap\\u00f3s-gradua\\u00e7\\u00e3o que \\u00e9 vista como uma sequ\\u00eancia natural e essencial para o futuro professor.<\\/p><div class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-card__actions\\\"><a class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-card__button\\\" href=\\\"#\\\">Fluxograma<\\/a><br \\/><a class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-card__button\\\" href=\\\"#\\\">Ementas<\\/a><\\/div><\\/article><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><section class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-grid\\\" aria-label=\\\"Se\\u00e7\\u00f5es principais da gradua\\u00e7\\u00e3o\\\"><article class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-section\\\"><div class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-section__head\\\"><p><span class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-section__eyebrow\\\">Apresenta\\u00e7\\u00e3o<\\/span><\\/p><h2>Ingresso e organiza\\u00e7\\u00e3o do curso<\\/h2><\\/div><div class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-section__body\\\"><p>O ingresso no curso ocorre por meio do vestibular, com entrada no primeiro semestre de cada ano no turno Manh\\u00e3\\/Tarde e no segundo semestre no turno Tarde\\/Noite.<\\/p><p>O curso encontra-se em sua 7\\u00aa vers\\u00e3o e passa por constante an\\u00e1lise, buscando atender \\u00e0s normas vigentes e \\u00e0s demandas da sociedade.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/article><article class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-section\\\"><div class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-section__head\\\"><p><span class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-section__eyebrow\\\">Estrutura e forma\\u00e7\\u00e3o<\\/span><\\/p><h2>Ambiente acad\\u00eamico e oportunidades<\\/h2><\\/div><div class=\\\"fisica-graduacao-section__body\\\"><p>O Instituto disp\\u00f5e de biblioteca voltada para a gradua\\u00e7\\u00e3o, com espa\\u00e7o de estudo para os estudantes.<\\/p><p>Anualmente, s\\u00e3o oferecidas oportunidades em projetos de Inicia\\u00e7\\u00e3o Cient\\u00edfica, Est\\u00e1gios, Inicia\\u00e7\\u00e3o \\u00e0 Doc\\u00eancia e Extens\\u00e3o, visando aprimorar a forma\\u00e7\\u00e3o acad\\u00eamica e fortalecer a intera\\u00e7\\u00e3o entre discentes e docentes da Universidade.<\\/p><p>O curso de F\\u00edsica prepara o estudante para atuar em pesquisa, ensino e em \\u00e1reas que exigem s\\u00f3lida forma\\u00e7\\u00e3o em F\\u00edsica.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/article><\\/section><\\/section>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(7868,1255,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(7869,1255,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(7870,1255,'_elementor_version','3.32.1'),(7871,1255,'_wp_page_template','elementor_header_footer'),(7872,1255,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"fisicadocenteshtmlv2\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"fisicadocenteshtmlwidgetv2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"fisica-docentes-page\\\" data-docentes-app>\\n  <style>\\n  \\n  \\n    .fisica-docentes-page {\\n      --fisica-doc-bg: #f5f8fc;\\n      --fisica-doc-card: #ffffff;\\n      --fisica-doc-card-soft: #edf5ff;\\n      --fisica-doc-text: #16324f;\\n      --fisica-doc-text-soft: #557089;\\n      --fisica-doc-primary: #0f4c81;\\n      --fisica-doc-primary-strong: #0b2f4a;\\n      --fisica-doc-accent: #59a8ff;\\n      --fisica-doc-border: rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.14);\\n      --fisica-doc-shadow: 0 24px 56px rgba(11, 47, 74, 0.12);\\n      --fisica-doc-shadow-soft: 0 14px 30px rgba(11, 47, 74, 0.08);\\n      max-width: 1400px;\\n      margin: 0 auto;\\n      padding: 28px 18px 70px;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text);\\n      font-family: \\\"Segoe UI\\\", \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, sans-serif;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-page * {\\n      box-sizing: border-box;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-hero {\\n      position: relative;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n      margin-bottom: 26px;\\n      padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px);\\n      border-radius: 30px;\\n      background:\\n        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(89, 168, 255, 0.32), transparent 28%),\\n        linear-gradient(135deg, #0b2f4a 0%, #0f4c81 58%, #1f6fb4 100%);\\n      box-shadow: 0 26px 58px rgba(11, 47, 74, 0.22);\\n      color: #ffffff;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-hero::after {\\n      content: \\\"\\\";\\n      position: absolute;\\n      inset: auto -70px -90px auto;\\n      width: 260px;\\n      height: 260px;\\n      border-radius: 50%;\\n      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0));\\n      pointer-events: none;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-eyebrow {\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 8px;\\n      padding: 8px 14px;\\n      border-radius: 999px;\\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.12em;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-hero h1 {\\n      margin: 16px 0 12px;\\n      max-width: 14ch;\\n      font-size: clamp(30px, 4.3vw, 50px);\\n      line-height: 1.02;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n      color: #ffffff;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-hero p {\\n      max-width: 74ch;\\n      margin: 0;\\n      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);\\n      font-size: 16px;\\n      line-height: 1.75;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview {\\n      display: grid;\\n      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.8fr) repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\\n      gap: 18px;\\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card {\\n      padding: 22px 22px 20px;\\n      border-radius: 24px;\\n      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f8fbff 100%);\\n      border: 1px solid var(--fisica-doc-border);\\n      box-shadow: var(--fisica-doc-shadow-soft);\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card strong {\\n      display: block;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 42px);\\n      line-height: 1;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card span {\\n      display: block;\\n      margin-top: 8px;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text-soft);\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      line-height: 1.6;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card--lead {\\n      background:\\n        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98) 0%, rgba(237, 245, 255, 0.96) 100%);\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card--lead h2 {\\n      margin: 0 0 10px;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      font-size: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 30px);\\n      line-height: 1.15;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card--lead p {\\n      margin: 0;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text-soft);\\n      font-size: 15px;\\n      line-height: 1.7;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-toolbar {\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n      gap: 16px;\\n      margin-bottom: 18px;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-search {\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 12px;\\n      min-width: min(100%, 460px);\\n      padding: 14px 18px;\\n      border-radius: 18px;\\n      background: #ffffff;\\n      border: 1px solid var(--fisica-doc-border);\\n      box-shadow: var(--fisica-doc-shadow-soft);\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-search span {\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary);\\n      font-size: 16px;\\n      font-weight: 700;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-search input {\\n      flex: 1 1 auto;\\n      min-width: 0;\\n      border: 0;\\n      outline: none;\\n      background: transparent;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      font-size: 15px;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-search input::placeholder {\\n      color: #7b90a4;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-toolbar__info {\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text-soft);\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      line-height: 1.6;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tabs {\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\\n      gap: 12px;\\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab {\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 12px;\\n      appearance: none;\\n      border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.16);\\n      background: #ffffff;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary);\\n      border-radius: 18px;\\n      padding: 14px 16px;\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      line-height: 1.3;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n      cursor: pointer;\\n      box-shadow: var(--fisica-doc-shadow-soft);\\n      transition: transform 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease, background 180ms ease, color 180ms ease;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab:hover,\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab:focus-visible {\\n      transform: translateY(-2px);\\n      border-color: rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.34);\\n      outline: none;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab.is-active {\\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f4c81 0%, #1f6fb4 100%);\\n      color: #ffffff;\\n      border-color: #0f4c81;\\n      box-shadow: 0 20px 34px rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.22);\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab__label {\\n      text-align: left;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab__count {\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      min-width: 32px;\\n      padding: 4px 9px;\\n      border-radius: 999px;\\n      background: rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.08);\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      line-height: 1;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab.is-active .fisica-docentes-tab__count {\\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel {\\n      display: none;\\n      border: 1px solid var(--fisica-doc-border);\\n      border-radius: 28px;\\n      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f7fbff 100%);\\n      box-shadow: var(--fisica-doc-shadow);\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel.is-active {\\n      display: block;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__head {\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\\n      align-items: flex-end;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n      gap: 18px;\\n      padding: 24px 24px 18px;\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.08);\\n      background:\\n        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(89, 168, 255, 0.18), transparent 28%),\\n        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.06), rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.02));\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__eyebrow {\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\\n      padding: 7px 12px;\\n      border-radius: 999px;\\n      background: rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.08);\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary);\\n      font-size: 11px;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.12em;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__head h2 {\\n      margin: 0;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px);\\n      line-height: 1.1;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__head p {\\n      margin: 10px 0 0;\\n      max-width: 70ch;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text-soft);\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      line-height: 1.7;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__meta {\\n      min-width: 150px;\\n      padding: 14px 16px;\\n      border-radius: 18px;\\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\\n      border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.12);\\n      text-align: right;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__meta strong {\\n      display: block;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      font-size: 30px;\\n      line-height: 1;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__meta span {\\n      display: block;\\n      margin-top: 6px;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text-soft);\\n      font-size: 13px;\\n      line-height: 1.5;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table-wrap {\\n      width: 100%;\\n      overflow-x: auto;\\n      padding: 0 0 4px;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table {\\n      width: 100%;\\n      min-width: 980px;\\n      border-collapse: separate;\\n      border-spacing: 0;\\n      background: #ffffff;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table thead th {\\n      position: sticky;\\n      top: 0;\\n      z-index: 1;\\n      padding: 16px 18px;\\n      background: #eaf3ff;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.14);\\n      font-size: 13px;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n      text-align: left;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table tbody tr {\\n      transition: background 180ms ease;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) {\\n      background: #f9fcff;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table tbody tr:hover {\\n      background: #eef5ff;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table td {\\n      padding: 18px;\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.08);\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text);\\n      font-size: 15px;\\n      line-height: 1.65;\\n      vertical-align: top;\\n      text-align: left;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table td:first-child {\\n      min-width: 270px;